Pattern Recognition

        I’ve seen this pattern before.

        Example
            Two Pointers, Sliding Window, DFS, DP

        How
            Map new problem to previously solved template/pattern

        Fails When
            Problem looks similar superficially,
            But underlying property/invariant is different so template not working

Brain memorizes steps/templates,
not why those steps are valid,
so solving becomes iterative bug fixing instead of derivation
